{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"t":"READING","y":0.14389534869406395,"w":0.1234567896525065,"x":0.41563786021489901},{"t":"READING PASSAGE 1","w":0.28600822448730467,"x":0.086419755967726053,"h":0.014723203769140047,"c":1,"y":0.20053003552630733},{"w":0.76131688435872391,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 1-13, which are based on Reading","x":0.08847736018401936,"c":1,"y":0.23546511611989551,"h":0.017479524735988683},{"y":0.25290697660184902,"h":0.014534883982160851,"x":0.086419753902208546,"c":1,"t":"Passage 1 below.","w":0.1604938252766927},{"x":0.086419753336751809,"y":0.31831395327737977,"w":0.018518517812093099,"h":0.013081395583944833,"c":1,"t":"A"},{"t":"Could urban engineers learn from dance?","h":0.020429301177655068,"x":0.23662552528969474,"y":0.28916372225663478,"w":0.48353907267252605,"c":1},{"y":0.31831395334218149,"h":0.015988372380376759,"t":"The way we travel around cities has a major impact on whether they are sustainable.","w":0.67489710489908861,"c":1,"x":0.12757202357732117},{"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"t":"Transportation is estimated to account for 30% of energy consumption in most of the","x":0.12962963578026812,"y":0.33421672556922732,"w":0.68106994628906248},{"w":0.72646072387695315,"h":0.019008569077131221,"x":0.12957413045207336,"t":"world's most developed nations, so lowering the need for energy-using vehicles is essential","y":0.35006901521819789,"c":1},{"w":0.73056833902994789,"c":1,"y":0.36763959134876711,"h":0.017569019600696345,"x":0.12956154447845034,"t":"for decreasing the environmental impact of mobility. But as more and more people move to"},{"h":0.016003780005537038,"y":0.38515901083354309,"c":1,"x":0.12962961916671947,"t":"cities, it is important to think about other kinds of sustainable travel too. The ways we travel","w":0.73456792195638021},{"t":"affect our physical and mental health, our social lives, our access to work and culture, and","y":0.40025630597517092,"c":1,"w":0.7161660766601563,"x":0.1295660683399808,"h":0.018459690754489499},{"w":0.71810699462890626,"h":0.016024324441826665,"t":"the air we breathe. Engineers are tasked with changing how we travel round cities through","c":1,"x":0.12962963015468271,"y":0.4186046510168101},{"c":1,"t":"urban design, but the engineering industry still works on the assumptions that led to the","y":0.43604651148177798,"w":0.69958847045898442,"x":0.12962963298038421,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"t":"creation of the energy-consuming transport systems we have now: the emphasis placed","h":0.016020900088288825,"c":1,"y":0.45200235586684323,"x":0.12962963392775048,"w":0.69341562906901033},{"w":0.68106994628906259,"c":1,"x":0.12962963580799708,"y":0.46937573600097515,"t":"solely on efficiency, speed, and quantitative data. We need radical changes, to make it","h":0.016195524146054296},{"c":1,"t":"healthier, more enjoyable, and less environmentally damaging to travel around cities.","x":0.12955711389564045,"h":0.020214067331051133,"y":0.48334589439156583,"w":0.68119679768880204},{"x":0.12962963831692623,"y":0.51148409914659665,"t":"Dance might hold some of the answers. That is not to suggest everyone should dance their","w":0.72016459147135425,"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"t":"way to work, however healthy and happy it might make us, but rather that the techniques","y":0.52906976730888555,"w":0.70781890869140618,"c":1,"x":0.12962964020162199,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"x":0.12962963109909253,"y":0.54505300370093146,"w":0.71193415323893228,"c":1,"t":"used by choreographers to experiment with and design movement in dance could provide","h":0.015993508068214979},{"c":1,"w":0.7223116556803385,"t":"engineers with tools to stimulate new ideas in city-making. Richard Sennett, an influential","y":0.56096774780767056,"x":0.12958357571032983,"h":0.016776324160949874},{"h":0.017488084215719124,"c":1,"x":0.12962963574138389,"t":"urbanist and sociologist who has transformed ideas about the way cities are made,","y":0.57703488390781432,"w":0.65637858072916666},{"w":0.71193415323893228,"x":0.12962963638464894,"h":0.015988371257085521,"c":1,"t":"argues that urban design has suffered from a separation between mind and body since the","y":0.59447674444413157},{"h":0.01909745961111764,"x":0.12734226907593652,"c":1,"y":0.60925637466831128,"w":0.34206715901692708,"t":"introduction of the architectural blueprint."},{"h":0.017441860778592999,"t":"Whereas medieval builders improvised and adapted construction through their intimate","w":0.69753087361653643,"x":0.12962962482415605,"c":1,"y":0.63662790681349779},{"x":0.12962961821946919,"w":0.74074076334635419,"t":"knowledge of materials and personal experience of the conditions on a site, building designs","y":0.65400471130512472,"h":0.01750691675606264,"c":1},{"h":0.016043156420524562,"w":0.68518519083658846,"t":"are now conceived and stored in media technologies that detach the designer from the","c":1,"x":0.12962962675081285,"y":0.6700581393874887},{"y":0.68749999985359478,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"w":0.71399175008138016,"x":0.1296296392534011,"t":"physical and social realities they are creating. While the design practices created by these"},{"y":0.704941860318827,"w":0.71604939778645837,"c":1,"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"new technologies are essential for managing the technical complexity of the modern city,","x":0.12962962199759631},{"h":0.017667844522968212,"t":"they have the drawback of simplifying reality in the process.","x":0.12962962278444895,"y":0.71937573633401097,"c":1,"w":0.48559672037760421},{"t":"To illustrate, Sennett discusses the Peachtree Center in Atlanta, USA, a development typical","x":0.12962962871786979,"y":0.74558303913451118,"w":0.7366255187988282,"c":1,"h":0.017498355591395454},{"h":0.017674302886315885,"t":"of the modernist approach to urban planning prevalent in the 1970s. Peachtree created a grid","c":1,"x":0.12957639854512157,"y":0.76279559361001437,"w":0.74084192911783853},{"h":0.014534883982160851,"y":0.78052325568121317,"t":"of streets and towers intended as a new pedestrian-friendly downtown for Atlanta. According","x":0.1316872486593394,"w":0.73868311564127609,"c":1},{"w":0.72222223917643236,"y":0.79651162774717843,"c":1,"x":0.12962962106263926,"t":"to Sennett, this failed because its designers had invested too much faith in computer-aided","h":0.017441860778592888},{"y":0.81389870418492372,"c":1,"t":"design to tell them how it would operate. They failed to take into account that purpose-built","h":0.016043156420524562,"x":0.12962961911590903,"w":0.73456792195638032},{"w":0.7407407633463543,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"x":0.12962961823200497,"y":0.8312720848948062,"t":"street cafés could not operate in the hot sun without the protective awnings common in older"},{"w":0.72016459147135414,"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"buildings, and would need energy-consuming air conditioning instead, or that its giant car","c":1,"y":0.84738372078406543,"x":0.12962963830916729},{"c":1,"y":0.86482558124927866,"h":0.015988372380376759,"x":0.12962962010835943,"t":"park would feel so unwelcoming that it would put people off getting out of their cars. What","w":0.72839508056640612},{"y":0.88074204921931287,"w":0.74074076334635408,"t":"seems entirely predictable and controllable on screen has unexpected results when translated","h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"x":0.12962961823544447},{"t":"into reality.","y":0.89766804937857558,"h":0.014482392579562853,"w":0.095246715545654281,"x":0.12929423640241122,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"37","x":0.84567901244883914,"w":0.024691357612609877,"y":0.91860465095950117,"h":0.01453488398216074}]}